   "legenda": "Comment “AGENCY” and I’ll DM you the link to build your own agents, plus the full guide.\n\nAn agency owner is paying a motion designer, a creative director, and a designer to do what three bots now do in a group chat.\n\nGrok Bot from xAI runs one task per bot. So you make three, each with one job, and they share one cloud computer.\n\nThe Motion Agent takes a brief and hands back a finished 9:16 ad. Storyboard, Remotion build, render.\n\nThe Visuals Agent takes the client brief and builds the whole campaign world. Reference frames, product shots, b-roll.\n\nThe Design Agent ships the file the client actually opens. Figma, on brand, correct dimensions.\n\nThe real unlock is the handoff. Each bot’s description tells the others what it owns, so anything outside its lane gets passed along without you touching it.\n\nPut all three in one group chat and you stop being the middleman on your own projects.\n\nThen you just text them like teammates. One designer shipped 74 assets in two hours this way.\n\nComment “AGENCY” and I’ll DM you the link to build your own agents, plus the full guide.\n\n@grok \n\n#aiagents #aitools #agencyowner #grokbot #spacexaipartner",
