   "legenda": "Comment “STACK” and I’ll send you the full guide: the setup order, 15-minute quick starts, and the weekend build plan.\n\nEveryone’s trying to make one AI tool do everything. That’s why their output is mediocre.\n\nThe fix is a stack where every tool has exactly one job.\n\nExa handles research, so you stop guessing and start citing.\nClaude Code builds the apps — you describe the outcome, it writes the code.\n\nHermes runs 24/7 on a $5 server, sending your morning briefing to Telegram while you sleep.\n\nWispr Flow turns your rambling voice into clean text, way faster than you type.\n\nBeehiiv owns your audience — the one channel no algorithm can take from you.\n\nHiggsfield generates the visuals, Remotion turns them into templates you never rebuild.\n\nObsidian remembers everything, forever, in files you actually own.\n\nEight tools. Eight jobs. One person.\n\nYou can set up the whole thing in one weekend — the guide walks you through it step by step.\n\nComment “STACK” and I’ll send you the full guide.\n\nShare this with someone trying to run their entire one-person business inside a single ChatGPT tab.\n\n#aitools #solopreneur #claudecode #aistack #onepersonbusiness",
